1
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:30,000
The end of the world is just the tip of the iceberg.

2
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:54,000
Ice Age: Continental Drift is a animation, comedy,
adventure film directed by Steve Martino.

3
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:18,000
Manny, Diego, and Sid embark upon another adventure
after their continent is set adrift.

4
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:42,000
Using an iceberg as a ship, they encounter sea creatures and
battle pirates as they explore a new world.

5
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Manny (voice), played by Ray Romano.

6
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:30,000
Sid (voice), played by John Leguizamo.

7
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:54,000
Diego (voice), played by Denis Leary.

8
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:18,000
Crash (voice), played by Seann William Scott.

9
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:42,000
Eddie (voice), played by Josh Peck.

10
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Ellie (voice), played by Queen Latifah.

11
00:48:24,000 --> 00:48:30,000
Ice Age: Continental Drift is a 2012 American animated
adventure comedy film produced by Blue Sky Studios.

12
00:52:48,000 --> 00:52:54,000
The fourth in the Ice Age film series, it was directed by Steve Martino and
Michael Thurmeier and written by Michael Berg and Jason Fuchs.

13
00:57:12,000 --> 00:57:18,000
Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Denis Leary and Queen Latifah reprise their roles from the
previous films, with Jennifer Lopez, Drake, and Nicki Minaj joining the cast.

14
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:42,000
The film involves Scrat mistakenly sending Manny, Sid, and Diego adrift on an iceberg with
Sid's Granny, leading them to face a gang of pirates led by Captain Gutt.

15
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
The film premiered at CineEurope on June 20, 2012, and was theatrically
released in the United States on July 13 by 20th Century Fox.

16
01:10:24,000 --> 01:10:30,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics and grossed $877 million worldwide, making it the
fifth highest-grossing film and the highest-grossing animated film of 2012.

17
01:14:48,000 --> 01:14:54,000
A further sequel, Ice Age: Collision Course, was released in 2016.

18
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:18,000
The film explores themes of villain, sequel,
prehistory, seal (animal), aftercreditsstinger.

19
01:23:36,000 --> 01:23:42,000
The tone is lighthearted.
